{%- comment -%} Indoor sensor from the markup's own merge variable sensor_readings (TRMNL adds it at render time, the transform never sees it): the newest reading of temperature and humidity of this screen's own device (device_<trmnl.device.id>, no other device's sensor; no id: no indoor reading), none when over 3 h older than the render time. Then ph (the payload's small overlay: the BINNEN readout, the humidity twin meter's key) applies: inn is its readout, ph_tw the key of the meter that gets a twin; the page script merges the same overlay into SW and puts the real values in. {%- endcomment -%}
