 temperature first (the largest element), the condition icon and text, the clothing cue (half vertical and full only, owner: not in the tiny views), the rain calendar with its rain icon (else today's
 low/high), the meters only when they fit readable. The page script (swSmall) sizes every part from the digit height and drops lower
